  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p>Razor Bugs are small, disc-shaped insects engineered by the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Yuuzhan_Vong\" title=\"Yuuzhan Vong\">Yuuzhan Vong</a> to serve as ranged Weapons. Though they are thrown by hand, Razor Bugs are shaped in such a way that they fly with great speed, distance, and accuracy, making them an effective replacement for longer-ranged Weapons. </p><p>A thrown Razor Bug is treated as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Simple_Weapon_(Ranged)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Simple Weapon (Ranged)\">Simple Weapon (Ranged)</a>, not a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Thrown_Weapon\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Thrown Weapon\">Thrown Weapon</a>, for purposes of determining <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Range\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Range\">Range</a>. </p><p><b>Accurate:</b> This weapon takes no penalty when firing at targets at Short&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Range\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Range\">Range</a>. </p>",
